  "onbPublicosTitle": "PublicOS",
  "onbPublicosSubtitle": "Own your self",
  "onbPublicosBody": "PublicOS is a social platform with its own infrastructure, governance, and economy: a public institution on the internet, owned by the people who use it.\n\nYou get a full domain of your own, a place to post, organize, and monetize any way you want.\n\nEverything runs in the open and is decided by liquid democracy: every rule, every vote, every token, verifiable by anyone.\n\n",
  "onbInfraTitle": "How does it work?",
  "onbInfraSubtitle": "Two networks, one place",
  "onbInfraBody": "PublicOS economy takes common internet mechanics and runs them as public services democratically managed on a blockchain, no enterprise owns your stuff:\n\n- Account data and business logic are run and stored transparently on a blockchain\n\n- Your posts, photos and files live on an email like network, where independent providers all connect to each other\n",
  "onbAccountsTitle": "Accounts",
  "onbAccountsSubtitle": "The four account types you'll interact with in PublicOS",
  "onbAccountsSelfPrefix": "You're currently a ",
  "onbCitizenWord": "citizen",
  "onbPrivateWord": "private",
  "onbCitizenLabel": "CITIZEN",
  "onbCitizenDesc": "Humans vouched on a social graph, free public services, one vote.",
  "onbPublicOrgLabel": "PUBLIC ORG",
  "onbPublicOrgDesc": "Citizen collectives of any type and size.",
  "onbPrivateLabel": "PRIVATE",
  "onbPrivateDesc": "Anonymous accounts, no vouching needed.",
  "onbPrivateOrgLabel": "PRIVATE ORG",
  "onbPrivateOrgDesc": "Citizen and private mixed collectives for groups and businesses.",
  "onbMorphAccountTitle": "Your Account",
  "onbMorphAccountSubtitle": "Smart",
  "onbMorphAccountBody": "Everything you do on PublicOS runs through one smart account. \n\nIt's your name and address, it keeps your records, assets and a public record of keys you authorize to sign with.\n\nLet's see how it comes together.",
  "onbMorphDomainTitle": "Your Domain",
  "onbMorphDomainSubtitle": "The name people use to find you",
  "onbMorphDomainBody": "Your **domain** is your readable name, the handle others type to reach you.",
  "onbDomainBodyCitizen": "Your **domain** is your readable name, the handle others type to reach you.\n\nYou hold **citizenship**, so yours is free for life.",
  "onbDomainBodyPaid": "Your **domain** is your readable name, the handle others type to reach you.\n\nYour account is **private**, and your domain is **already paid for**.",
  "onbDomainBodyRent": "Your **domain** is your readable name, the handle others type to reach you.\n\nPrivate accounts pay a **domain fee** to keep theirs. Set yours up below and you're ready.",
  "onbMorphAddressTitle": "Your Account Address",
  "onbMorphAddressSubtitle": "What the domain points at",
  "onbMorphAddressBody": "Your domain may change, but it always resolves to the same address on the chain.\n\nIt's your account's smart contract address, it runs by PublicOS rules, and holds your account's data.",
  "onbMorphRecordsTitle": "Your Records",
  "onbMorphRecordsSubtitle": "What your account holds",
  "onbMorphRecordsBody": "Records are pieces of information you choose to make public like your avatar and banner, the tabs that point out to your chats, your websites, your feeds.\n\n Take a look, open the tabs sheet.",
  "onbMorphSafeTitle": "Your Safe",
  "onbMorphSafeSubtitle": "Where your assets are kept",
  "onbMorphSafeBody": "Linked to your account sits a federated safe: a smart vault that holds your tokens and assets.\n\nIt's programmable, you can set rules and modules to manage as you like.",
  "onbBspTitle": "Blockchain Provider",
  "onbBspSubtitle": "Your gateway to the chain",
  "onbBspBody": "BSPs are public notaries. They verify every transaction is valid and signed by you, record it and share with other BSPs threading a ledger anyone can audit.\n\nIt is one transparent spreadsheet of balances and smart contracts. BSPs keep it running and connect you to it.",
  "onbBspPrivateNote": "As a private, you can connect via the Public RPC or subscribe to a BSP (each sets its own fair-use policy).",
  "onbSspTitle": "Social Provider",
  "onbSspSubtitle": "Where your feeds live",
  "onbSspBody": "An SSP hosts what any social media app would: your feeds, media, and social content.\n\nPick one to get started, or bring your own. You can always explore PublicOS first and add one later.",
  "onbSspPrivateNote": "As a private account this is an optional subscription, paid directly to your provider.",
  "onbProviderCitizenNote": "Free for you, the network covers provider fees for citizens.",
  "onbEconomyTitle": "Economy",
  "onbEconomySubtitle": "Sovereign",
  "onbEconomyBody": "PublicOS runs its own currency, **ox ¤**, managed like a national economy.\n\n**Contractors** (BSPs and SSPs) run the services. PublicOS mints ox to cover citizens' use of them.\n\n**Domains** are a second market: citizens get one as a public right, while the rest trade on the open market.\n\nThe idea: **you are the platform's value**, so you earn a little ox whenever services are paid. Check the Treasury often.",
  "onbContractTitle": "The social contract",
  "onbContractSubtitle": "Our constitution",
  "onbContractBody": "Citizenship is a public right. In return, you honor one pledge:\n\n**Vouched accounts are humans.** If it ever mattered, you could point to a real person behind anyone you vouch for.\n\nYou vouch for **humanity, not morality**. You are never responsible for what others do, only for the truth of your vouch.",
  "onbKeysTitle": "Keys",
  "onbKeysSubtitle": "The ink behind your signature",
  "onbKeysBody": "Everything you do on chain is \"signed\" with your keys, the way a pen signs in ink.\n\n**Private key**: your secret. A signature made with it proves it's you, and only you can make one. Never share it.\n\n**Public address**: your shareable identifier. It lets anyone confirm a signature is really yours.\n\nCreate your first key, and keep its recovery phrase somewhere safe.",
  "onbXmtpTitle": "XMTP",
  "onbXmtpSubtitle": "Private messaging, no middleman",
  "onbXmtpBody": "PublicOS messages run on XMTP's decentralized network.\n\n**Many inboxes.** Make as many separate ones as you want.\n\n**No middleman.** End to end encrypted.\n\nAny key can create or join an Inbox ID.",
  "onbInboxTitle": "Inbox IDs",
  "onbInboxSubtitle": "Your messaging address",
  "onbInboxBody": "Treat inbox IDs as emails, some are to be kept off chain and private, some are public and shareable.\n\nPublish it to your profile with the \"tab\" button so people can reach you, it links your account to your messaging inbox on-chain.",
  "onbGetAroundTitle": "Get around PublicOS",
  "onbGetAroundSubtitle": "Three things worth knowing",
  "onbManualTitle": "Manual",
  "onbManualBody": "Everything about PublicOS, at your own pace, what the words mean, how the money works, what you can do. In your **Apps**.",
  "onbLibraryTitle": "Library",
  "onbLibraryBody": "How PublicOS works, in depth: what things cost, the rules, every contract. In your **Apps**.",
  "onbSupportTitle": "Support",
  "onbSupportBody": "An assistant lives on the **publicos** profile, under **support**. Ask it anything, in **any language**.",
  "onbDone": "DONE",
  "onbEnter": "ENTER PUBLICOS",
  "onbContinue": "CONTINUE",
  "onbClaimCitizenship": "CLAIM CITIZENSHIP",
