  "onbSkip": "SKIP",
  "onbRedoHintTitle": "You're all set",
  "onbRedoHintBody": "Want to keep learning? Open the Users Manual app, it's already in your Apps. You can pick or change your providers any time from the Settings app, and redo this whole intro from there too.",
  "onbYoursCreateInboxFirst": "CREATE YOUR INBOX FIRST",
  "onbYoursTitle": "A WAY IN",
  "onbYoursSubtitle": "A profile, but no door.",
  "onbYoursBody": "You have an account, but there's still no way to reach you.\n\nPublish an **inbox** as a tab and people can find you under your name.",
  "onbYoursAddInbox": "ADD MY FIRST INBOX",
  "onbYoursHaveBody": "You already have an **inbox**, people can reach you under your name.\n\nWant to see how another one gets published?",
  "onbYoursUnknownBody": "Your **inbox** may already be published, we couldn't check just now.\n\nCarry on, or walk through publishing one.",
  "onbYoursShowMeHow": "SHOW ME HOW",
  "onbTabsBody": "Your name can hold more than one **tab**. You published an inbox, that is one.\n\nEverything below is added later from your account page. Nothing else is needed today.",
